id: supercomputer-mark
name: Mental Supercomputer
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Mental Supercomputer's mark.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Mental Supercomputer: Strike 1(T) and Wound 2(T) till the end of your turn.
text: >
  Mental Supercomputer (2): When you use the Analysis or Hype Maneuver, increase your Strike and Wound Rolls by 1(T) and 2(T) respectively until the end of your turn.

---

[passive]
strike += 1(T);
wound += 2(T);
